  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/langs2/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review at dev 100b6fbb6e: filed fixture through analyze_kotlin: A(class) -> A.helper at lines 3 (get()) and 5 (set()), A -> A.helper2 at line 6, A.run -> A.helper at 7; the A.twice / A.setter field symbols exist and span the accessors. In survey the line-3 and line-5 edges collapse into one A -> A.helper. The C# sibling WI-binap is done; kotlin.py commits since filing (2e78e70d27 gikuk etc.) did not touch accessor anchoring. MECHANISM: kotlin enclosing-callable set lacks property_declaration accessors; falls back to _TYPE_BODY_NODES (the class)."  # 99f9
